@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginAdv

; ========================================
; 魔女裁判 序章
; ========================================

# Scene1-0-1

@SetCustomVariable Expression:"g_gameProgress = max(1, g_gameProgress)"
@SetCustomVariable Expression:"hasWitchBook = false"

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐0-1
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:——这里是囚牢。|#0101Adv01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:樱羽艾玛只想捂紧耳朵，<br>抵挡身边涌现的恶意。|#0101Adv01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，她被无形的锁链束缚着，<br>就像个囚犯一样，连捂紧耳朵也做不到。|#0101Adv01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时被锁在厕所隔间里。|#0101Adv01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时课本被撕毁丢弃。|#0101Adv01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时室内鞋里被塞满了虫。|#0101Adv01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时被集体暴打施以私刑。|#0101Adv01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时被绑起来当众羞辱。|#0101Adv01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时。有时。有时——|#0101Adv01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:霸凌日益变本加厉，<br>她的心脏好似灌铅般愈发沉重。|#0101Adv01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住手吧。<br>住手。住手。住手住手住手。|#0101Adv01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要再欺负人了！！|#0101Adv01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唯有这句话不管怎样都说不出口。|#0101Adv01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被辱骂、被欺侮、被嘲笑，<br>每日如此，不见尽头。|#0101Adv01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如此残酷的行为，竟长期持续，未曾断绝。|#0101Adv01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她不禁开始责备比任何人都胆小的自己。<br>她太过讨厌自己，甚至想要就此消失。|#0101Adv01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对一成不变的日常感到绝望的艾玛，<br>堕入了无边的黑暗之中。|#0101Adv01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:周围的少女们，不断地发出欢声笑语。|#0101Adv01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不想被讨厌，不想被讨厌啊。<br>为什么要这样？可不可以不要这样。|#0101Adv01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心在持续发出沙哑的呜咽。|#0101Adv01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:长期以来，艾玛一直在责备着自己——|#0101Adv01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 黒]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:但某天她忽然发现了答案。|#0101Adv01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了——|#0101Adv01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都去死就好了。|#0101Adv01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

@GotoModified Path:Act01_Chapter01/Act01_Chapter01_Adv02 SoftReset:true

